		<kudos_nice><![CDATA[Nice!]]></kudos_nice>
		<perfectLandings><![CDATA[Perfect landings:]]></perfectLandings>
		<finalScore><![CDATA[Final score:]]></finalScore>
		<resultHigh><![CDATA[You're a cheerleading champ! Keep going to see if you can beat your own best score!]]></resultHigh>
		<resultMiddle><![CDATA[Way to cheer! Keep playing to unlock more super stunts!]]></resultMiddle>
		<resultLow><![CDATA[You've got team spirit! Keep practicing – you'll learn some new stunts in no time!]]></resultLow>
